{
  "job_B8.4.3.2_20251003_114848": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fee. He \u00fea him andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, hwylc is min modor & mine gebro\u00feru? & he cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00f0a behealdende \u00fee him abuton s\u00e6ton, her is min modor & mine gebro\u00f0ru. So\u00f0lice se \u00f0e de\u00fe Godes willan, se is min modor & min bro\u00f0or & swustor. & eft he ongan hi \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 l\u00e6ran, & him w\u00e6s mycel menegu togegaderod, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he on scip eode, & he hi fela on bigspellum l\u00e6rde, & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his lare. Gehyra\u00f0; Ut eode se s\u00e6dere his s\u00e6d to sawenne. & \u00fea he sew sum feoll wi\u00f0 \u00feone weg, & fugelas comon & hit fr\u00e6ton. Sum feoll ofer stanscyligean \u00fear hit n\u00e6fde mycele eor\u00f0an, & sona up eode, & for\u00feam hit n\u00e6fde eor\u00fean \u00dea hit upeode, seo sunne hit forsw\u00e6lde, & hit forscranc, for\u00feam hit wyrtruman n\u00e6fde. & sum feoll on \u00feornas, \u00fea stigon \u00f0a \u00feornas & for\u00f0rysmodon \u00fe\u00e6t, & hit w\u00e6stm ne b\u00e6r. & sum feoll on god land & hit sealde uppstigende & wexende w\u00e6stm; & an brohte \u00feritigfealdne, sum And he cw\u00e6\u00f0, gehyre se \u00f0e earan h\u00e6bbe to gehyranne. & \u00fea he ana w\u00e6s hine axodon \u00fe\u00e6t bigspell \u00fea twelfe \u00fee mid him w\u00e6ron. & he s\u00e6de him, eow is geseald to witanne Godes rices gerynu; \u00feam \u00fee ute synt ealle \u00feing on \u00de\u00e6t hi geseonde geseon & na ne geseon & gehyrende gehyren & ne ongyten \u00fee l\u00e6s",
